WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.948 --> 00:00:16.690
was a big train crash," Roxy thought.

2
00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:18.231
"I have to help!"

3
00:00:19.933 --> 00:00:21.474
Roxy ran back to her friends.

4
00:00:21.494 --> 00:00:25.216
"I'll be right back, guys.

5
00:00:25.737 --> 00:00:29.900
I want to go see the, um, crocodiles one more time!"

6
00:00:32.072 --> 00:00:34.333
"Wait!" called Jack as Roxy ran off.

7
00:00:34.354 --> 00:00:36.255
"We'll come too.

8
00:00:37.035 --> 00:00:38.216
I love crocodiles!"

9
00:00:39.156 --> 00:00:40.637
But Roxy was already gone.

10
00:00:42.618 --> 00:00:43.879
Mara pointed at the sky.

11
00:00:43.899 --> 00:00:47.061
"Look! It's Rocket Girl!"

12
00:00:48.902 --> 00:00:52.084
Roxy flew over the train tracks until she reached the scene of the crash.

13
00:00:53.885 --> 00:00:55.026
It was a huge mess.

14
00:00:56.047 --> 00:00:58.048
Cars from the two trains were jumbled together.

15
00:00:59.192 --> 00:01:02.034
Strange smoke poured from some cars and filled the air.

16
00:01:03.336 --> 00:01:05.277
Zoo animals were running in every direction.

17
00:01:06.278 --> 00:01:08.840
Police officers and a zookeeper were trying to catch them.

18
00:01:10.061 --> 00:01:12.042
Rocket Girl landed next to Detective Smith.

19
00:01:12.062 --> 00:01:15.926
"Is there trouble with your train set, Detective?"

20
00:01:16.146 --> 00:01:16.586
she asked.

21
00:01:16.606 --> 00:01:21.170
"Ha-ha." Detective Smith pretended to laugh.

22
00:01:21.190 --> 00:01:24.532
"This is no time for jokes, Rocket Girl."

23
00:01:24.552 --> 00:01:27.094
"I know," said Roxy.

24
00:01:27.114 --> 00:01:28.736
"Was anybody hurt?"

25
00:01:30.048 --> 00:01:31.389
Detective Smith shook his head.

26
00:01:31.409 --> 00:01:34.771
"Luckily no people or animals were hurt.

27
00:01:35.631 --> 00:01:37.552
But now the animals are escaping."

28
00:01:38.953 --> 00:01:39.493
He coughed.

29
00:01:39.513 --> 00:01:44.236
"And this smoke is terrible.

30
00:01:44.996 --> 00:01:46.997
The firefighters can't get rid of it."

31
00:01:48.318 --> 00:01:49.359
Roxy looked around.

32
00:01:50.199 --> 00:01:52.921
Two firefighters were spraying the train cars with a hose.

33
00:01:53.921 --> 00:01:55.402
But the smoke was still thick.

34
00:01:57.263 --> 00:01:58.524
Roxy took a deep breath.

35
00:01:59.496 --> 00:02:01.117
Then she blew as hard as she could.

36
00:02:01.137 --> 00:02:05.619
Whoosh! Her super breath blew away the smoke.

37
00:02:05.639 --> 00:02:09.981
"Thank you, Rocket Girl," said the zookeeper.

38
00:02:10.001 --> 00:02:13.002
"Now we can see the animals and catch them!"

39
00:02:14.002 --> 00:02:18.524
As the zookeeper and police officers chased animals, Roxy picked up train cars.

40
00:02:20.805 --> 00:02:23.006
She put them back on the tracks, one by one.

41
00:02:25.347 --> 00:02:27.188
Detective Smith came over with a toucan.

42
00:02:29.536 --> 00:02:32.077
"I think we caught all the animals," he said.

43
00:02:32.097 --> 00:02:35.678
"Let's count them to make sure," said the zookeeper.

44
00:02:36.998 --> 00:02:38.559
The zookeeper counted the animals.

45
00:02:40.699 --> 00:02:42.080
He made notes on a clipboard.

46
00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:44.820
When he was done, he scratched his head.

47
00:02:44.840 --> 00:02:47.381
"One animal is still missing."

48
00:02:54.083 --> 00:02:54.943
Then he gasped.

49
00:02:54.963 --> 00:02:56.784
"Where's Blue Baboon?"

50
00:02:57.876 --> 00:02:59.958
Suddenly a loud sound shook the ground.

51
00:02:59.978 --> 00:03:03.500
"Wah-hu! Wah-hu!"

52
00:03:04.901 --> 00:03:06.022
The zookeeper frowned.

53
00:03:06.042 --> 00:03:08.663
"That sounds like Blue Baboon," he said.

54
00:03:08.683 --> 00:03:09.984
"But louder."

55
00:03:11.245 --> 00:03:11.925
Roxy nodded.

56
00:03:11.945 --> 00:03:13.566
"And bigger!"

57
00:03:14.907 --> 00:03:17.309
Stomp, stomp, stomp!

58
00:03:18.290 --> 00:03:19.410
The ground shook again.

59
00:03:20.271 --> 00:03:21.972
Everyone turned to look toward the sound.

60
00:03:23.293 --> 00:03:26.135
A huge cloud of chemical smoke moved across a farm field.

61
00:03:27.336 --> 00:03:29.602
Stomp, stomp, stomp!

62
00:03:30.643 --> 00:03:34.047
"There's something inside that chemical cloud," said Detective Smith.

63
00:03:34.868 --> 00:03:38.672
"Do you think it's The zookeeper dropped his clipboard.

64
00:03:38.692 --> 00:03:40.834
"Blue Baboon!"
